Package: wiki.qaq.unfaird
Name: unfaird (iPhone 11 Taurine)
Version: 0.1.16
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Asspp on-device IPA decrypt daemon for iPhone 11.
 Profile: iOS 14.3, Taurine/Procursus rootful, arm64, kernrw runtime adapter.
 Requires on device: OpenSSH, AppSync Unified, appinst, libhooker and Procursus/libkernrw.
 Includes verified UnfairRuntimeRunner, UnfairRuntimeDumper and fouldecrypt.kernrw adapters.
 Default policy: compatible extensions, batch size 4, 512 MB Jetsam limit.
Section: Utilities
Maintainer: LiBr <me@nvme0n1p.dev>
Author: LiBr <me@nvme0n1p.dev>
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
Provides: wiki.qaq.assppweb
Replaces: wiki.qaq.assppweb
